        "src:8823919736b1#p1.65"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F6",
      "kind": "situation",
      "status": "assessed",
      "fact": "Supporters of placement under the Joint Chiefs of Staff argued that intelligence and strategic planning are closely related, and that this arrangement had the support of the Joint Chiefs and the three military department secretaries.",
